# Scopes the VlgMail Docker build context (the project root -- see
# infra/lib/mail-stack.ts) to exactly what mailer/Dockerfile COPYs.
# Without this, CDK's asset staging and the docker build walk the whole
# project -- Files/, app/, .git, infra/node_modules, Claude outputs/ --
# which stalled a K1x deploy for minutes (K1x commit 1888a1c).
*
!mailer/Dockerfile
!mailer/handler.py
!mailer/requirements.txt
!mailer/smoke_test.py
!output_report
!static-site/data.json
output_report/__pycache__
output_report/**/*.pyc
output_report/Dockerfile
output_report/*.pdf
output_report/preview_output
